WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:05.557
VoxelTTO spends 93% of a scene fixing the poses.

00:00:05.557 --> 00:00:10.724
Voxel-anchored Gaussians, plus LoRA adapted at test time against the poses.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:16.477
Mean rotation error on Tanks and Temples.

00:00:16.477 --> 00:00:21.823
Without TTO, 1.636°; with twenty TTO steps, 0.262°.

00:00:21.823 --> 00:00:23.828
That is 6.2×.

00:00:23.828 --> 00:00:29.841
The test-view gap closes from 9.03 dB to 1.66.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:35.256
92.7% of the per-scene cost is test-time optimisation.

00:00:35.256 --> 00:00:39.155
The author's reconciliation of the paper's runtimes.

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:46.739
−2.85 dB input-view PSNR on Tanks and Temples, the price of fitting the poses.

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:50.418
TTO is not making the model better.

00:00:50.418 --> 00:00:52.663
It chooses whose coordinate frame wins.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:59.858
Every number here is from the full article, with its sources, at ai.thesatyajit.com.
